					<string name="Name">Giver Instructions</string>
					<ProtectedString name="Source">--DONT PUT THIS IN ANYTHING IT&apos;S JUST INSTRUCTIONS.
--First Place the &quot;Please put me inside the weapon or tool!&quot; script in your weapon or tool.
--Then place your weapon or tool in the &quot;PUT THE WEAPON IN THIS BRICK&quot; brick.

--IMPORTANT (OPTINAL)
--Before doing anything you should put the Weapon or Tool in the giver where you want it.
--Do not put these instrucions in the in any other giver unless you want to make a instructions :)
</ProtectedString>
